                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ijwi lya-Leza lili abuumi, lili anguzu, lilabosya kwiinda iceba ilijisi mabemba obile, lilayasa mane kukwaanzaanya buumi amuuya, aalo maswaanganino aazifuwa amooma, alimwi lilabeteka kuyeeya akuyanda kwamoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takukwe cintu cakalengwa icitabwenekede mumeso aakwe, pele zyoonse zilivumbulwidwe, zili antangalala, kulinguwe oyo ngutujisizi makani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
