                  "text": "Rom 3:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kaako, atuswene cakutayoowa kucuuno caluzyalo, kuti tukatambule lweetelelo akujana luzyalo lutugwasya muciindi ncotubula.",
          "type": "text",
